message: "If you use this software in research, please cite this release."
title: "Solana Collateral Identity Scanner"
version: 0.5.0
date-released: 2026-11-06
type: software
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/madfloyd2016/solana-collateral-scanner"
authors:
  - name: "madfloyd2016"
abstract: >-
  A read-only static triage tool for Solana DeFi lending, collateral,
  reserve, and vault programs. It combines heuristic source scanning,
  asset-identity dataflow review, Anchor account-constraint mapping,
  Token-2022 extension policy signals, arithmetic review leads, and
  protocol-inspired synthetic regression fixtures.
